t.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231227900331"},{"id":"D16","kind":"DART 공시","title":"불성실공시법인지정예고(공시불이행)","date":"2023-12-08","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231208900665"},{"id":"D17","kind":"DART 공시","title":"소송등의제기ㆍ신청(경영권분쟁소송)(장부등열람허용가처분신청)","date":"2023-11-01","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20231101900250"},{"id":"D18","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(자기주식처분결정)","date":"2023-03-23","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230323000753"},{"id":"D19","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2023-02-28","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230228901016"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-20","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250320001557"}]}